{'symbol': 'EQIX', 'date': '2021-04-26 08:01:00', 'title': 'BUSINESSES IN SIX NEW GLOBAL MARKETS CAN NOW ACCESS PRIVATE CLOUD ON-RAMPS TO MICROSOFT AZURE EXPRESSROUTE ON PLATFORM EQUINIX', 'text': "REDWOOD CITY, CALIF., APRIL 26, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0EQUINIX, INC.\xa0(NASDAQ: EQIX), THE WORLD'S DIGITAL INFRASTRUCTURE COMPANY™, TODAY ANNOUNCED IT IS EXPANDING PRIVATE NETWORK ACCESS TO MICROSOFT AZURE VIA AZURE EXPRESSROUTE ON PLATFORM EQUINIX® TO SERVICE CUSTOMERS IN SIX NEW GLOBAL MARKETS, INCLUDING BERLIN, BOGOTÁ, CANBERRA, DUBAI, RIO DE JANEIRO\xa0AND SEOUL."}